  "releaseNotes": "Correctness release. Elapsed time is now measured in whole days as the reference does; State.New cards schedule instead of throwing; out-of-range ratings are rejected rather than silently indexing the weight array; the fuzzer is thread-safe; FsrsParameters is immutable. Breaking: FsrsParameters.Weights is IReadOnlyList and constructor-only, GetCardRetrievability takes an optional clock, and IFsrsCalculator exposes Decay/Factor.",
